5. **Added 11 new tests** — covering ref parsing (HEAD~3, branches, commit ranges, hashes, @~2, HEAD^), --stat vs --explain precedence, file-path-not-treated-as-ref, and the `looks_like_git_ref` heuristic itself

### Changes to `src/help_data.rs`:

